<item><title>Burkina Faso’s zinc mine resumes operations under state subsidiary</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-s-zinc-mine-resumes-operations-under-state-eb17e1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-s-zinc-mine-resumes-operations-under-state-eb17e1/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>The mine had been shut since 2022 floods that killed eight people; the transition president is due to attend its restart.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:10:38 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" length="35711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
