<item><title>AUXFIN Burkina Faso seeks infrastructure pledges for rural communities</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/auxfin-burkina-faso-seeks-infrastructure-pledges-for-rural-b1b221/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/auxfin-burkina-faso-seeks-infrastructure-pledges-for-rural-b1b221/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>The social enterprise, AUXFIN Burkina Faso, brought partners together in Ouagadougou to present community needs and seek commitments to meet them.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:58:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" length="35711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burkina Faso reviews study of maternal and child mortality declines</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-reviews-study-of-maternal-and-child-mortality-b150b7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-reviews-study-of-maternal-and-child-mortality-b150b7/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>Research partners presented findings in Ouagadougou after maternal mortality fell 47% and deaths of children under five fell 78% from 1998 to 2021.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:55:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-reviews-study-of-maternal-and-child-mortality-b150b7/share.jpg" length="43564" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-reviews-study-of-maternal-and-child-mortality-b150b7/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
